    <p style="margin-top:.75rem;margin-bottom:0;color:#63553F;">Neither runs the kind of affiliate program that supports our own code, so both are the best public codes we've verified. Instabridge's 20% off beats RedteaGO's 5% off on percentage alone, but Instabridge's code only works on its web store, never typed into the phone app; see its page for why.</p>
